                       Brasa\n                            </h3>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-1-2\">\n                                al fuego\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mosaic-block__media\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-2\">\n                            <img alt=\"Carne y patatas en bandeja oscura, fotografía de Eiliv Aceron en Unsplash\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-2-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594489883219-010b0e5eeb9d?auto=format&w=620&q=80&fit=crop\"/>\n                        </div>\n                        <ul class=\"price-list\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3\">\n                            <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-1\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-1-1\">\n                                    1/4 pollo + patatas\n                                </span>\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-1-2\">\n                                    6,50 €\n                                </strong>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-2\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-2-1\">\n                                    1/2 pollo + patatas\n                                </span>\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-2-2\">\n                                    9,50 €\n                                </strong>\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-3\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-3-1\">\n                                    Pollo entero + patatas\n                                </span>\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3-3-3-2\">\n                                    12,50 €\n                                </strong>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"mosaic-block mosaic-block--extras\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4\">\n                        <div class=\"mosaic-block__title\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-1\">\n                            <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-1-1\">\n                                Extras\n                            </h3>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-1-2\">\n                                para acompañar\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2\">\n                            <ul class=\"price-list\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1\">\n                                <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-1\">\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-1-1\">\n                                        Samosa\n                                    </span>\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-1-2\">\n                                        4,00 €\n                                    </strong>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-2\">\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-2-1\">\n                                        Box kebab pequeño\n                                    </span>\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-2-2\">\n                                        4,00 €\n                                    </strong>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-3\">\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-3-1\">\n                                        Alitas de pollo\n                                    </span>\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-2-1-3-2\">\n                                        4,00 €\n                                    </strong>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3\">\n                            <ul class=\"price-list\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1\">\n                                <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-1\">\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-1-1\">\n                                        Milhojas\n                                    </span>\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-1-2\">\n                                        2,50 €\n                                    </strong>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-2\">\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-2-1\">\n                                        Arroz con leche\n                                    </span>\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-2-2\">\n                                        2,50 €\n                                    </strong>\n                                </li>\n                                <li class=\"price-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-3\">\n                                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-3-1\">\n                                        Helado\n                                    </span>\n                                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4-3-1-3-2\">\n                                        2,50 €\n                                    </strong>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"editorial-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4\">\n                    * Precios y nombres mostrados como contenido de trabajo. Confirma disponibilidad, ingredientes, alérgenos y suplementos en cada local.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"proof-title\" class=\"brand-proof\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\">\n            <div class=\"sufi-container brand-proof__inner\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\">\n                <div class=\"proof\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\">\n                    <p class=\"proof__label\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\" id=\"proof-title\">\n                        Identidad de marca\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\">\n                        Halal\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1\"/>\n                        100%\n                    </h2>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-3\">\n                        Mensaje presente en el material facilitado. Validación documental pendiente si se comunica como certificación.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"proof\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\">\n                    <p class=\"proof__label\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\">\n                        Producto\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\">\n                        Carne\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1\"/>\n                        de calidad\n                    </h2>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3\">\n                        Una promesa visual de SUFI KEBAB, sin estrellas ni reseñas inventadas.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\" class=\"contact\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" id=\"contacto\">\n            <div class=\"sufi-container\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\">\n                <div class=\"contact__head\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\">\n                    <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\" id=\"contact-title\">\n                        Elige\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-1\"/>\n                        tu SUFI.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\">\n                        Los contactos se habilitarán al confirmar dirección, teléfono, WhatsApp y enlaces de cada sede.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"contact-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\">\n                    <article class=\"contact-panel\" data-contact=\"local-01\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"contact-panel__top\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1\">\n                            <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                SUFI 01\n                            </h3>\n                            <span class=\"contact-panel__state\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1-2\">\n                                Pendiente\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"contact-actions\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2\">\n                            <div aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"contact-action\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__label\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-phone icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Llamar\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__pending\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                                    Pendiente de confirmar\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"contact-action\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__label\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-brand-whatsapp icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    WhatsApp\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__pending\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-2-2\">\n                                    Pendiente de confirmar\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"contact-action\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-3\">\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__label\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-3-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-map-pin icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Cómo llegar\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__pending\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2-3-2\">\n                                    Pendiente de confirmar\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"contact-panel\" data-contact=\"local-02\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"contact-panel__top\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                SUFI 02\n                            </h3>\n                            <span class=\"contact-panel__state\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                Pendiente\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"contact-actions\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2\">\n                            <div aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"contact-action\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__label\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-phone icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Llamar\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__pending\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-1-2\">\n                                    Pendiente de confirmar\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"contact-action\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__label\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-brand-whatsapp icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    WhatsApp\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__pending\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-2-2\">\n                                    Pendiente de confirmar\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div aria-disabled=\"true\" class=\"contact-action\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-3\">\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__label\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-3-1\">\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-map-pin icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-3-1-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Cómo llegar\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"contact-action__pending\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2-3-2\">\n                                    Pendiente de confirmar\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n                <div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"contact-summary\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-1\">\n                        Estado de selección\n                    </span>\n                    <strong data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3-2\" data-name=\"selected venue summary text\" data-reason=\"text updated when a local is selected\" id=\"selected-venue\">\n                        Selecciona un local arriba\n                    </strong>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"site-footer\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n        <div class=\"sufi-container\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\">\n            <div class=\"site-footer__top\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\">\n                    <a aria-label=\"Volver al inicio\" class=\"wordmark\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" href=\"#top\">\n                        <span class=\"wordmark__lockup\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1\">\n                            <span class=\"wordmark__sufi\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1-1\">\n                                SUFI\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"wordmark__kebab\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1-2\">\n                                KEBAB\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                    <p class=\"footer-copy\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\">\n                        Dos locales. Una misma identidad. La carta completa y los datos de cada sede se publicarán tras su confirmación.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <nav aria-label=\"Enlaces del pie\" class=\"footer-links\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\">\n                    <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-1\" href=\"#locales\">\n                        Locales\n                    </a>\n                    <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2\" href=\"#carta\">\n                        Destacados\n                    </a>\n                    <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-3\" href=\"#servicios\">\n                        Servicios\n                    </a>\n                    <a data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-4\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                        Contacto\n                    </a>\n                </nav>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"footer-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\">\n                    SUFI KEBAB · 2026\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\">\n                    Precios de trabajo · datos por confirmar\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n<script>\n    document.querySelectorAll('.venue-card input').forEach((input) => {\n    input.addEventListener('change', () => {\n      const value = input.value === 'local-01' ? 'SUFI 01 seleccionado · contacto pendiente' : 'SUFI 02 seleccionado · contacto pendiente';\n      const selected = document.querySelector('#selected-venue');\n      const note = document.querySelector('#venue-help span');\n      if (selected) selected.textContent = value;\n      if (note) note.textContent = value + ' · confirma los datos antes de contactar.';\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n",
